note SPDX-License-Identifier MIT
note Philox4x32-10 from Salmon et al Parallel Random Numbers As Easy As 1 2 3
note Independent implementation of the published algorithm no vendor source
note Words are carried as ulong but explicitly reduced modulo 2^32
fn philox a edit ulong 4 k0 ulong k1 ulong to void
x = k0
y = k1
for r ulong 10
p = mul get a 0 3528531795
q = mul get a 2 3449720151
u = xor xor shr q 32 get a 1 x
v = xor xor shr p 32 get a 3 y
put a 0 and u 4294967295
put a 1 and q 4294967295
put a 2 and v 4294967295
put a 3 and p 4294967295
x = and add x 2654435769 4294967295
y = and add y 3144134277 4294967295
end
end
